  m_Text: "Controls\n\u2022 Set **Server base URL** to your PC\u2019s Django URL
    (e.g. http://192.168.1.10:8000). Run: python manage.py runserver 0.0.0.0:8000\n\u2022
    Tap **Refresh model list** \u2014 completed jobs with model.glb appear; tap a
    row to load (no copy/paste).\n\u2022 Or paste a full GLB URL and tap **Load GLB**.\n\u2022
    Aim the ray, pull trigger (or pinch). Passthrough = your room behind the UI;
    enable in Meta Quest settings if needed."
